    },
    {
      "displayText": "*keuch* *ächz*<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002A006B0065007500630068002A0020002A00E400630068007A002A00100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Also... Was hältst du von Scanner? Ganz anders\nals Schutzschild, findest du nicht auch?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Stimmt, sie sind völlig verschieden!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300740069006D006D0074002C0020007300690065002000730069006E00640020007600F6006C006C0069006700200076006500720073006300680069006500640065006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Also ich merke da keinen Unterschied...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C0073006F00200069006300680020006D00650072006B00650020006400610020006B00650069006E0065006E00200055006E007400650072007300630068006900650064002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ja, oder?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0061002C0020006F006400650072003F00100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du machst Witze!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400750020006D006100630068007300740020005700690074007A0065002100100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Klar, beide Attacken schützen Pokémon vor\nSchaden, also ist die Wirkung identisch...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nenn mich wählerisch, aber ich finde Scanner\neinfach tausendmal cooler!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Und letztlich sind es ja solche Präferenzen, die\neinen als Trainer ausmachen, oder?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSolang man nur nicht allzu wählerisch wird!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
